	(text "Low power solenoid drivers (sol. 9-16): IRLR3110Z logic-level DPAK MOSFETs (14 mOhm), latch U4 output HIGH = ON, clocked by /SOL 3 (J113-11).\nTie-back diodes S3M (SMC, 3 A) to +50V (~70 V DC in the machine): coils in this group can be PWM-held by the firmware, the diode then carries the freewheel current.\nOutput connectors J127 (playfield, key pin 2), J129 (backbox, sol 9-12, key 3) and J128 (cabinet, sol 13-16, key 4) as on the A-12697. Supply +50V via F104 on J107-2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e1d8dbfe-00a1-4344-b005-9ac0b5b4238a")
	)
